{
 "name": "The Cabal of the Inverted Star",
 "verb": "CAST",
 "identity": "Warp-geomancer sorcerers, hollow automata and mutating spawn. Every Sorcerer casts one spell per activation: cast safely on 2D6 or channel on 3D6 for a stronger effect and a backlash risk. Signature trick: swapping two of your units.",
 "number": "14",
 "template": "C_gunline_siege_arcane",
 "status": "draft",
 "learned_from": [
  "Gemini #1 spell resource without a magic phase, #2 Inverted Geometry swap, #3 All Is Dust (renamed effect)",
  "User: spells with buffs, debuffs and risk; GW spell names (a signature spell, a signature spell) avoided"
 ],
 "risk_profile": "Chosen per cast: 2D6 is safe, 3D6 channel adds power and backlash.",
 "core_rule": {
  "name": "The Inverted Rite (spells)",
  "text": "Each Sorcerer (a Leader with a [PSYCHIC / ARCANE] weapon) may cast 1 spell per activation without spending an Action; each spell once per round for the army. Roll 2D6 (safe) or 3D6 (channel: the effect is doubled where marked ×2; if 2+ dice show a 1, the Sorcerer suffers D3 Fatal Wounds). Spells: Hex-Bolt (6+) D3 Fatal Wounds to an enemy unit within 18″ ×2 · Veil of Mirrors (6+) a friendly unit within 12″ is −1 to be Hit until the End of Round · Warp-Breach (7+) a friendly unit's weapons get +1 PEN this round · Withering Gaze (7+) an enemy unit within 18″ gets −1 to Hit until the End of Round · Chrono-Step (8+) a friendly unit within 12″ makes a 3″ move ×2 · Inverted Geometry (9+) swap two friendly unengaged units within 18″ of the Sorcerer (counts as their move)."
 },
 "gamble": {
  "name": "Channel the Star",
  "text": "Built into every cast: roll 3D6 instead of 2D6 — marked effects are doubled; if two or more dice show a 1, the Sorcerer suffers D3 Fatal Wounds.",
  "risk_cost": "durability (dice)"
 },
